#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:7
#: 32fd88ab617f40fcb894927b9b9a421a
msgid "Copter supports **Precision Landing** and **Precision Loiter**, which use an external position reference (aka \"landing target\") to achieve centimeter-level accuracy during landing or while hovering over a target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:9
#: 6ecaf7cc62164b159ac5673448f65768
msgid "Precision Landing is supported via MAVLink `LANDING_TARGET <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ messages sent from a companion computer such as :ref:`BlueOS <precision-landing-blueos>`, the `Landmark system <https://landmarklanding.com/products/landmark-precision-landing-system>`__, or using the `IR-LOCK sensor <https://irlock.com/products/ir-lock-sensor-precision-landing-kit>`__, `beacon <https://irlock.com/products/markone-beacon-v3-0-beta>`__, and a :ref:`rangefinder <common-rangefinder-landingpage>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:14
#: 5dc61bb137b447599e1905790bbb9591
msgid "When the vehicle enters :ref:`Land mode <land-mode>` and a landing target is detected, the target's position will be used to guide the final descent. Precision Landing can also be performed in :ref:`RTL mode <rtl-mode>` as the final stage of the return-to-launch sequence."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:17
#: d1f03b77e7a345dfa156d0620f247a21
msgid "Precision Loiter requires minimal additional setup and is activated by entering :ref:`Loiter mode <loiter-mode>` mode and invoking the Precision Loiter :ref:`Auxiliary Function <common-auxiliary-functions>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:22
#: a82b53ea84ab4bbeb08402861a6a7c3c
msgid "*This video demonstrates Precision Loiter followed by Precision Landing using the Landmark Precision Landing System.*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:26
#: 7cf08ec8559441729ef4115b401052d9
msgid "Available Systems"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:37
#: 373eb3bc0cc84fab942733c31ea67d89
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:39
#: c6db65cfbcde42838524429fe1ae3466
msgid "Set :ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>` = **1** and reboot to expose parameters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:40
#: c4fdf65050ab43738a9b7d6cd90dae6f
msgid "Select the landing target position source via :ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>` (e.g., **1** = MAVLink `LANDING_TARGET <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__, **2** = IR-LOCK, **3** = Gazebo Sim, **4** = SITL; **0** disables)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:41
#: 79e43bc26ba84539a2fd28d829d0b358
msgid "If the landing target camera/sensor x-axis is not pointing forward, configure the mounting orientation using :ref:`PLND_YAW_ALIGN <PLND_YAW_ALIGN>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:42
#: be37f57fbc644d568a4f41a2e44bdb14
msgid "Verify the target is detected while disarmed and the reported offsets change as you move the target/vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:43
#: 67b74f1d3db94547a218edfd335a5409
msgid "Take off and hover above the target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:44
#: a04d1c62d00f4cdf92780034498ce994
msgid "(Recommended) Confirm stable tracking in Precision Loiter before attempting Precision Landing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:45
#: bb61c05e822b4d7aa48facc9a56dfe9d
msgid "Activate :ref:`Land mode <land-mode>` to initiate Precision Landing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:48
#: 48ec04de21684b07872ebe31e1857f28
msgid "Precision Landing requires a valid horizontal position estimate and a steady attitude solution. Poor GPS/EKF or a noisy rangefinder will degrade performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:52
#: 43e4ce043b8743148c80cd933a3259a6
msgid "Operation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:54
#: 7f416e73392644ddac5b74625fff1299
msgid "With Precision Landing enabled and Land mode activated, the external landing target measurements override the target provided by the GPS solution for the final approach."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:56
#: a9a9a61510cb44f984a5db8ddb4b812c
msgid "If the landing target is not found, the vehicle will continue descending vertically until the height specified by :ref:`PLND_ALT_MAX <PLND_ALT_MAX>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:58
#: 0c512cbfdda047cbaa1898ddf2c75417
msgid "If the landing target is lost, the behaviour depends on :ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:60
#: 5b16c9df3d8a4a4a9ec433db6ad9d07e
msgid "**0** – continue landing using standard Land mode logic (not strict)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:61
#: e6f0f7b7723e4f0cba4eca63aa898cc1
msgid "**1** – perform landing retries until :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` is reached, then land normally."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:62
#: 26f270f5f57e4dc09f8a5dcd6866cc82
msgid "**2** – perform landing retries until :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` is reached, then hover instead of landing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:64
#: 44aa2e99655e4d0da8f59e6322195fab
msgid "When a landing retry is triggered, the vehicle will climb to a height/position determined by :ref:`PLND_RET_BEHAVE <PLND_RET_BEHAVE>`. It will then descend again in hopes of detecting the landing target. It will keep doing this until :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` retries have occurred. Then, depending on :ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>`, the vehicle will either just land, or it will stay in the air hovering (useful for, say, landing on boats where you don’t want to land on water)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:70
#: 10bd91adf72c4eb689a5ef572791e98f
msgid "If the landing target is lost below the height specified by :ref:`PLND_ALT_MIN <PLND_ALT_MIN>`, the vehicle will continue landing vertically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:72
#: 8524d102c33a4dc790fd9c7480f94cc8
msgid "ArduPilot's EKF assumes the landing target is stationary. Set :ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` bit 0 if landing on a moving target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:74
#: 7cd50840f7f149a5bb4023c78bff20fe
msgid "Repositioning manually by the pilot during the landing will abort the landing unless :ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` bit 1 (Allow Precision Landing after manual reposition)is set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:76
#: 96125769575a4a538779dd91a875d517
msgid "Final landing speed may be reduced below :ref:`LAND_SPD_MS<LAND_SPD_MS>` as necessary to assure a precise touchdown. This can be disabled for a faster final land speed by setting :ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` bit 2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:82
#: 3572a414405648118a9f47795365b28f
msgid "*This video demonstrates the behaviour of different PLND_STRICT settings.*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:86
#: 01b26828b1e140dd9968e004d6ddf43d
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:88
#: 60cf6e90fb014f179a8ed7d4f026eb3d
msgid ":ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>`: Set to 1 to enable Precision Landing. Refresh parameters to see following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:89
#: dd27a00a38684b8db0dd92b949e809fe
msgid ":ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>`: Sets the type of landing target position source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:90
#: 130a978bcc234b01831d076ed5966f7e
msgid ":ref:`PLND_YAW_ALIGN <PLND_YAW_ALIGN>`: Sets the mounting yaw orientation of the landing target camera/sensor with respect to body frame forward."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:91
#: 2c3a7c13540e4771a84758bf26241482
msgid ":ref:`PLND_LAND_OFS_X <PLND_LAND_OFS_X>` / :ref:`PLND_LAND_OFS_Y <PLND_LAND_OFS_Y>`: Sets the desired landing position of the camera/sensor relative to the target. See :ref:`common-sensor-offset-compensation` page for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:92
#: b4fbbc8e5479436e97e6804416fb3d4f
msgid ":ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_X <PLND_CAM_POS_X>` / :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Y <PLND_CAM_POS_Y>` / :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Z <PLND_CAM_POS_Z>`: Sets the camera/sensor position relative to the vehicle body frame."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:93
#: a1928e97ccb04e5d900a88b96e3f7db2
msgid ":ref:`PLND_XY_DIST_MAX <PLND_XY_DIST_MAX>`: Even if the landing target is detected, the vehicle will not start descending if it is further than this many meters away. Set to 0 to always descend."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:94
#: bde0b55e87ec4902adb235bac9566b28
msgid ":ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>`: Controls the landing behaviour if the target is lost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:95
#: 1ae21e0076494ff8bb73ba4762e3c504
msgid ":ref:`PLND_ALT_MIN <PLND_ALT_MIN>`: If the target is lost below this height, the vehicle will continue descending vertically. Set to 0 to disable this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:96
#: 45f343105aec4ce4a6363e2e6eccf9e7
msgid ":ref:`PLND_ALT_MAX <PLND_ALT_MAX>`: If the target is not detected, the vehicle will continue descending vertically until this height. Below this height, if the target is still not found, the landing retry logic set by :ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>` will be applied. Set to 0 to disable this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:97
#: da059605558e4f8d82ad15c0c0f5d442
msgid ":ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>`: Set bit 0 if landing target is moving, set bit 1 to allow the precision landing to continue after a manual reposition, and set bit 2 to enable a faster final descent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:99
#: fc96e3e2aec24fd9a6a62a28f3bfbf0d
msgid "Additional ``PLND_`` parameters are listed in the `Complete Parameter List <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#plnd-parameters>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:103
#: 6b6523ecb4b84d478efe7d087b2a324f
msgid "Precision Loiter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:105
#: cdff1de8e52b4e2b8b07e0a7e9061941
msgid "Precision Loiter uses the same backend and parameters as Precision Landing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:107
#: 874ce00c2fbd4903bf04b857819d7e49
msgid "To enable Precision Loiter, set an :ref:`Auxiliary Function Switch <common-auxiliary-functions>` to 39 (PrecLoiter Enable)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:109
#: 95d887c3414d4cc3b4cd152470871e2a
msgid "Entering Loiter mode and activating the switch will cause the vehicle to hold its position above the target."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:113
#: aee0074618a446afb9848789ab7df728
msgid "MAVLink LANDING_TARGET Message Based Systems"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:115
#: d20398b298304a0d8187eba61141f11e
msgid "Using a companion computer, camera, and fiducial marker system such as `AprilTag <https://docs.wpilib.org/en/stable/docs/software/vision-processing/apriltag/apriltag-intro.html>`__, the position differences to the landing target location can be sent to the autopilot using MAVLink `LANDING_TARGET <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ messages. Here is an example system description: `Precision Landing with Realsense T265 Camera and AprilTag <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/precision-landing-with-realsense-t265-camera-and-apriltag-part-1-2/48978>`__"
msgstr ""
